WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.360
"Kodomo no Odocha"

00:00:11.530 --> 00:00:13.700
That rumor that I love you

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.330
is true, yes it is.

00:00:18.660 --> 00:00:20.830
You can't ignore it either.

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.420
Whether you're awake or asleep,

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:29.050
please don't be embarrassed.

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.640
Is it a sin if I sneak into your heart

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:40.310
by ridding you...

00:00:41.350 --> 00:00:43.480
...of your other love?

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.060
At sunset,

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:50.570
when the children go home,

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:54.490
Today's incident is burning love!

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:58.410
You can tell it accurately.

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:00.490
7 O'Clock News!

00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:04.290
Please, our relationship...

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:09.960
Please don't blame it on the true kiss

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:11.750
In a city without light,

00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:15.680
let's burn the fire of love.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:19.100
Don't be so easy going

00:01:19.180 --> 00:01:21.350
The existence is a mistake

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.850
You're asking for something not there.

00:01:32.190 --> 00:01:33.360
I'm Kurata Sana,

00:01:33.360 --> 00:01:37.200
a 6th grader and TV personality
affiliated with Gekidan Komawari!

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:38.620
Although, you know...

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:44.540
Ups-a-daisy...

00:01:44.540 --> 00:01:47.870
It can be really tough
being the lead character, ma'am.

00:01:47.870 --> 00:01:50.880
Hey! What are you doing!?
The show is starting-

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:54.210
What I'm saying is, let us do some stories
that are a little different once in a while.

00:01:54.210 --> 00:01:55.550
For example,
something like this.

00:01:55.550 --> 00:01:57.880
Look, could you not proceed
with things all on your own?

00:01:59.890 --> 00:02:01.640
Good morning!

00:02:01.640 --> 00:02:06.140
Kurata Sana is sorry that today, once again,
she is so cheerfully late for school!

00:02:06.140 --> 00:02:08.810
Oh, that hurt,
that hurt!

00:02:08.810 --> 00:02:11.810
So, Sana-chan, it looks like
nothing happened to you, huh?

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:13.480
W- what do you mean?

00:02:15.150 --> 00:02:17.150
Good morning.

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:20.030
What is this!?

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:25.160
"100 Haya-moths and the Scales of Fury"

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:29.170
"Kuraataland"

00:02:26.500 --> 00:02:29.170
What's the deal
with this ostentatious setting?

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:33.170
We've had it. We've all
been afflicted by Haya-moth.

00:02:33.170 --> 00:02:34.840
We've been turned into moths!

00:02:34.840 --> 00:02:37.670
Haya-moth?!
That jerk!

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:39.510
Then again,
this could be...

00:02:39.510 --> 00:02:40.840
...quite nice, maybe.

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:44.850
Could you stop fluttering around like that?
You're dragging me down.

00:02:44.850 --> 00:02:46.310
"Haya-moth would be..."

00:02:46.680 --> 00:02:50.850
...this unpleasant vermin, who has been
troubling Kuraataland of late.

00:02:50.850 --> 00:02:52.690
Well, excuse me!

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:55.860
I'm so embarrassed by this,
I can't go walking outside!

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:56.860
Aya-moth...

00:02:56.860 --> 00:03:00.530
No!!

00:03:00.530 --> 00:03:05.160
W- we all look like this now,
so don't worry about it.

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:07.120
I suppose that's true,
Hisae-moth.

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.500
"Hisae-moth"

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:09.500
Hey, I don't like
the way that sounds.

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:13.460
Okay, okay, everyone,
we're starting class.

00:03:13.460 --> 00:03:17.510
When it gets dark out, you may want to fly
near light bulbs and fluorescent lights,

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:21.510
but resist that urge as much as you can!
Getting too close is dangerous, okay?

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:23.970
Even Mitsuya-sensei has been turned
into Mitsuya-moth.

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:25.850
Now, Gomi-moth and Itami-moth,

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:28.520
--I'm the only one in the whole
class who is unaffected.
--you stay in your seats!

00:03:28.520 --> 00:03:29.810
We can't stand that!
We have to fly!

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:31.520
Sana-chan...

00:03:31.520 --> 00:03:35.480
I haven't seen Tsuyoshi-kun anywhere.
Do you know where he is?

00:03:35.480 --> 00:03:36.860
Oh, now that you mention it...

00:03:36.860 --> 00:03:41.820
What do I do? If Tsuyoshi-kun
sees me like this, I'll... I'll...

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:45.870
Then again, if Tsuyoshi-kun looks like this
too, we'll be Aya-moth and Tsuyoshi-moth.

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:47.160
What is it with you?

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:50.540
Princess Sana!
Terrible news!

00:03:50.540 --> 00:03:52.040
I- it's the queen!

00:03:52.040 --> 00:03:54.500
What? What?
What's the matter, Rei-kun?

00:03:54.500 --> 00:03:56.670
Queen Misako is not around!

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:59.550
Mama is probably just on
one of her usual jungle expeditions.

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:01.800
Well, actually...
In any case, to the palace!

00:04:01.800 --> 00:04:04.640
Hey, hold on, now! Hey!

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:06.140
Sana-chan is leaving
early again today, huh?

00:04:06.140 --> 00:04:10.140
--Must be tough, being a 6th grade
TV personality and princess and all, huh?
--Hey! How can you carry me like this!
Is this any way to treat a princess!?

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:12.480
--Then again, whoo! Yeah!
This is perfectly thrilling!
--Yeah.

00:04:12.480 --> 00:04:16.150
Ah, Tsuyoshi-kun... but then,
if he becomes Tsuyo-moth...

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:21.530
"And so, the princess goes to the palace"

00:04:16.810 --> 00:04:21.490
Babbit-moth!

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:23.150
Mama's protective suit?

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:25.160
Yes, it is still
there in her room.

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:28.530
"Kuraataland Palace"

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:28.530
The queen went into the jungle
without her protective suit!

00:04:29.490 --> 00:04:32.120
Here! This is where
Maro-chan goes.

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:32.120
"Safe!!"

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:36.500
Without her protective suit, she won't
be able to escape Haya-moth's scales.

00:04:36.500 --> 00:04:38.840
Now that all of her subjects
are rapidly turning into moths,

00:04:38.840 --> 00:04:41.510
if it should happen to the queen, too,
it would be an outrage of...

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:44.680
...mammoth proportions!

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.180
"Man moth" proportions...

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:51.350
"Mammoth"

00:04:46.180 --> 00:04:49.350
I've gone and made another
ridiculously cool play on words!

00:04:49.350 --> 00:04:51.350
I wonder if Princess Sana
will laugh at it.

00:04:51.350 --> 00:04:53.350
I'm going to go save Mama!

00:04:53.350 --> 00:04:54.350
She didn't laugh.

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:56.520
Bring me my protective suit!

00:04:56.520 --> 00:04:58.190
You mean... that?

00:04:58.190 --> 00:04:59.860
I'm completely protected!

00:04:59.860 --> 00:05:02.940
Where's the protection? That's a lot
different from this one, isn't it?

00:05:02.940 --> 00:05:05.110
Princess, dressed like that,
you really shouldn't...

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:08.120
No, I'm going! I'm wearing
this to go save Mama!

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:09.780
I'm home.

00:05:09.780 --> 00:05:10.790
M- Mama...

00:05:10.790 --> 00:05:12.120
Were you going out somewhere?

00:05:12.120 --> 00:05:13.790
No, I was just trying it on.

00:05:13.790 --> 00:05:15.960
But I'm so glad
you're unaffected, Mama!

00:05:15.960 --> 00:05:17.460
I wasn't unaffected.

00:05:20.460 --> 00:05:25.470
--M- my queen, what an unfortunate
form you've turned into...
--I got done in!
I got done in! I got done in!

00:05:26.130 --> 00:05:27.800
Even Maro-chan,
the chipmunk...

00:05:27.800 --> 00:05:30.140
Now, even Mama has been
snared by these scales...

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:33.140
You'll pay for this,
Haya-moth!

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:35.140
Then again,
this body is nice, too.

00:05:35.140 --> 00:05:35.810
Mama...

00:05:35.810 --> 00:05:38.730
That's pretty chic,
Misa-moth and Maro-moth.

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:47.150
What's with this thing!?

00:05:47.150 --> 00:05:49.490
--Princess Sana...
--What's going on!?
Which one's the steering wheel!?

00:05:49.490 --> 00:05:54.500
The fate of Kuraataland now rests
upon your shoulders. Please... please...

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:57.830
So, you're not going with her?

00:05:57.830 --> 00:06:00.500
Well, I've got Asako, and all...

00:06:00.500 --> 00:06:03.130
If anything were to happen to me,
Asako would be...

00:06:03.130 --> 00:06:04.800
Rei!

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:07.130
Y- you look lovely, Asako.

00:06:07.130 --> 00:06:09.470
Hmph. That's love for you.

00:06:09.470 --> 00:06:12.140
I should just about be at the forest
where Mama got done in.

00:06:12.140 --> 00:06:14.140
Just you watch, Haya-moth!
I will defeat you...

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:16.980
...no matter what!

00:06:16.980 --> 00:06:20.150
What are you doing here, Tsuyoshi-kun!?
What's more, you're unaffected!

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:24.150
I caught a cold, and was lying down at home,
so I wasn't set upon by Haya-moth.

00:06:24.150 --> 00:06:27.150
I heard that Aya-chan
had been afflicted, too.

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:32.160
For Aya-chan's sake, I will...
I will defeat Haya-moth!

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:33.990
Just because
you defeat Haya-moth

00:06:33.990 --> 00:06:37.160
doesn't necessarily mean it will return
Aya-chan and the others to normal.

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:39.170
This isn't a fairy tale,
after all.

00:06:39.170 --> 00:06:41.130
No... I couldn't take that!

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:47.840
Apparently, it was around here that Mama
was sprinkled with Haya-moth's scales.

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:49.340
Oh, a giraffe-moth...

00:06:49.340 --> 00:06:50.510
A lion-moth...

00:06:50.510 --> 00:06:51.510
And a zebra-moth...

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.180
A monkey-moth!

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:56.350
So humans aren't
Haya-moth's only victims.

00:06:58.180 --> 00:06:59.850
What are those?

00:06:59.850 --> 00:07:01.440
There you are,
Haya-moths!

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.770
--How dare you do that to Mama!
--How dare you do that to Aya-chan!

00:07:03.770 --> 00:07:07.110
Shut up! Shut up! Shut up!

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:09.110
Come on! Come on!
Take this!

00:07:09.110 --> 00:07:12.110
Amazing, Sana-chan!
You got the whole flock at once!

00:07:12.110 --> 00:07:14.450
--But Sana-chan, you're scaring me...
--You've had this coming a long time!

00:07:14.450 --> 00:07:17.450
This is for kissing me twice,
and feeling up my chest!

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:20.790
That was unexpectedly easy, huh?

00:07:20.790 --> 00:07:25.800
Easy-win samba! Victory mambo!
We're having steak tonight! We're so glad!

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:26.800
Hey...

00:07:26.800 --> 00:07:29.130
Don't sell us short!
Don't sell us short!

00:07:29.130 --> 00:07:31.470
Don't sell us short!

00:07:31.470 --> 00:07:34.800
--They're immortal!
--Hey, wait!

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:36.140
We're getting out of here!

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:37.470
Sana-chan, we're weak!

00:07:37.470 --> 00:07:38.980
Hey, wait!
Hey, wait!

00:07:38.980 --> 00:07:42.980
These are just the grubs, Tsuyoshi-kun.
We have to find the head guy!

00:07:42.980 --> 00:07:45.150
Grubs, are we?

00:07:45.150 --> 00:07:47.480
Tsuyoshi, why you...

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:49.150
--I'm scared!
--You've got some nerve!

00:07:49.150 --> 00:07:51.650
Their lack of expression is creepy!

00:07:51.650 --> 00:07:53.820
Tsuyoshi-kun,
hold on tight!

00:07:53.820 --> 00:07:54.820
What? What?

00:08:00.500 --> 00:08:03.080
You did it!
Incredible! Incredible!

00:08:03.120 --> 00:08:04.750
But Sana-chan,
aren't you getting dizzy?

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:07.130
My eyes are spinning
round and round!

00:08:07.130 --> 00:08:08.460
You guys are morons!

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:15.470
W- we're lucky
we survived, huh?

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:17.930
T- that's because
we had on airbags.

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:19.970
No time to sit here talking!
What's that!?

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:24.770
Is that the head Haya-moth?

00:08:24.770 --> 00:08:26.440
We found him fairly easily, huh?

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:28.440
We only have 15 minutes today.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:30.110
The second half will be great, too!

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:32.490
Hey!

00:08:32.490 --> 00:08:33.780
Occupied.

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:35.780
Look at that, he's got
better manners than I expected.

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:39.450
We might find him to be refreshing,
enemy though he is.

00:08:39.490 --> 00:08:42.500
What are you doing
in something like this?

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:45.500
I just played a little prank
on the god of the forest.

00:08:45.500 --> 00:08:48.840
As punishment, I've been turned into a moth,
and locked up inside here.

00:08:48.840 --> 00:08:50.340
You poor thing.

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:51.420
I became lonely,

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:54.180
so I sent out copies of myself
to try to make friends with everyone.

00:08:54.180 --> 00:08:57.470
However, people appear to dislike me now,
because of my scales.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:00.850
--What kind of prank
did you play on that god?
--That's awful! It's making me cry!

00:09:00.850 --> 00:09:05.770
I put a small landmine
on the forest god's chair.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:07.100
I heard it split his butt.

00:09:07.100 --> 00:09:10.440
How could he turn you into a moth
over something like that!?
That god sure is petty!

00:09:10.440 --> 00:09:12.780
I- I think it was a rather
terrible thing to do...

00:09:14.450 --> 00:09:16.450
Sana- I mean,
Princess!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:17.780
If you will behave yourself,

00:09:17.780 --> 00:09:20.450
and not make any more copies of yourself,
I'll let you out of there.

00:09:20.450 --> 00:09:22.120
How about it?

00:09:22.120 --> 00:09:24.120
Okay, I'll be a good boy.

00:09:24.120 --> 00:09:26.750
I'm not so sure!
I'm not so sure about this!

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:31.300
There now, Haya-moth.

00:09:33.460 --> 00:09:35.300
You completely fell for it!

00:09:35.300 --> 00:09:39.140
I'm finally out of there!
Thank you, you stupid Princess Sana.

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:41.310
I'm free!

00:09:41.310 --> 00:09:43.640
Y- you tricked me!

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:47.440
They're sticking to me!
The scales are sticking to me!

00:09:51.650 --> 00:09:53.820
Hi there,
I'm Sana-moth.

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.240
I'm Tsuyo-moth.

00:09:56.320 --> 00:09:59.820
Freedom is great! And here I am,
supposed to be afraid of heights.

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:01.660
Hey, you!

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:04.160
Wait the hell up, you dirty Haya-moth!
How dare you trick me!

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:08.170
--I'll kick your ass! I'll kill you!
--Those are pretty vulgar words
for a princess.

00:10:08.170 --> 00:10:09.670
You're lousy at flying.

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:13.170
I can't help it, you know!
I've only been a moth for 25 seconds!

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:16.170
Like this. Left and right sides
balanced and at the same time.

00:10:16.170 --> 00:10:17.510
L- like this?

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:22.510
When you get good at it,
you can even do stuff like this.

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:25.020
It will just make you
dizzy, though.

00:10:25.020 --> 00:10:27.850
You're pretty boneheaded
there, Haya-moth.

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:29.520
Still, flying is fun, huh?

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:32.520
Isn't it?
It's fun.

00:10:32.520 --> 00:10:35.190
This is a strange
development...

00:10:35.190 --> 00:10:36.860
Just a minute!

00:10:36.860 --> 00:10:38.860
Don't we give off scales?

00:10:38.860 --> 00:10:42.530
It's only me and my copies
that release scales.

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:45.200
Here is the thing
about boys and girls:

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:47.540
Students should act
like students.

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:50.880
Any vulgar speech, love-love
on school grounds, dueling,

00:10:50.880 --> 00:10:54.880
and dancing other than
limbo dancing is inexcusable!

00:10:54.880 --> 00:10:58.220
This has been
Andoh-moth's lecture.

00:10:58.220 --> 00:10:59.220
Hey!

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:03.140
Come down here! I'm going to spank you
until you can't scatter any more scales!

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.810
Shut up,
you wrinkled hag.

00:11:04.810 --> 00:11:07.640
You're scattering scales from
off your face yourself, aren't you?

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:12.480
By the way,
Kurata-san...

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:13.150
Yes?

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:15.480
You are the princess
of Kuraataland, right?

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:17.150
On, that's right.

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:20.820
You have a responsibility
to defend its people!

00:11:20.820 --> 00:11:24.490
As princess, you know
what to do, don't you?

00:11:26.990 --> 00:11:28.160
Haya-moth...

00:11:32.830 --> 00:11:35.000
"Haya-moth keel-over spray"

00:11:40.170 --> 00:11:43.840
Haya-moth, I am the
princess of Kuraataland.

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:46.510
I really do have
to put you down.

00:11:46.510 --> 00:11:50.520
I didn't want to take on
this form, either.

00:11:50.520 --> 00:11:52.980
If you're going to kill me,
then kill me.

00:11:54.520 --> 00:11:59.690
I had fun flying together
with you. Thank you.

00:12:01.490 --> 00:12:05.160
If I... If I wasn't the princess...

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:07.830
...we would have been able
to fly around forever.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:11.330
When I'm reincarnated,
I'll teach you other ways of flying.

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:17.210
I'm sorry,
Haya-moth!

00:12:26.510 --> 00:12:28.470
Sana- Princess!

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.190
Haya-moth!

00:12:33.190 --> 00:12:38.980
I'm sorry! I'm sorry, Haya-moth!
You were a really nice guy!

00:12:41.860 --> 00:12:44.030
W-W-wha-!?

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:48.530
I'm immortal,
remember?

00:12:48.530 --> 00:12:50.040
I forgot!

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:51.120
"I forgot!"

00:12:51.700 --> 00:12:56.540
Those who are put under spells
by gods become immortal.

00:12:56.540 --> 00:12:58.040
Bye-bee!

00:12:58.040 --> 00:13:01.800
Let's give it up.
This land is done for.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:03.130
He won't get away with this!

00:13:05.800 --> 00:13:08.640
Hey, wait the hell up!

00:13:12.470 --> 00:13:14.810
Are you mocking me!?

00:13:14.810 --> 00:13:16.810
Ooh, that was refreshing.

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:20.150
My queen! H- how did you
return to normal?

00:13:20.150 --> 00:13:22.480
I just took a bath.

00:13:22.480 --> 00:13:24.150
It looks like you return
to normal right away

00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:25.820
once you wash
the scales off your body.

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:27.490
What?

00:13:27.490 --> 00:13:29.830
Everyone is in a panic
because they've turned into moths,

00:13:29.830 --> 00:13:33.500
when all they have to do
is take baths. Isn't that dumb?

00:13:33.500 --> 00:13:37.170
Well, ordinarily, you don't
take baths when you're a moth.

00:13:37.170 --> 00:13:41.000
Why don't you go tell
everyone in the kingdom?

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:45.170
--D- does Princess Sana know about that?
--Didn't you hear me
when I told you to wait up!?

00:13:45.170 --> 00:13:47.180
Don't you speak Japanese!?

00:13:47.180 --> 00:13:50.510
I'll get you back for what you did
to Mama and Tsuyoshi-kun and the others!

00:13:50.510 --> 00:13:53.180
You can even
do stuff like this.

00:13:53.180 --> 00:13:54.850
L- like this?

00:13:54.850 --> 00:13:57.520
Hey, I said wait up!

00:13:57.520 --> 00:13:58.850
Aya-moth...

00:13:58.850 --> 00:14:00.190
Tsuyo-moth...

00:14:00.190 --> 00:14:03.440
Even as moths,
we're in love-love!

00:14:03.480 --> 00:14:05.820
Don't sell me short!

00:14:05.820 --> 00:14:08.660
I'm going to put you down,
no matter what!

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:12.160
"Back against the wall."

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:16.120
That's what you say
about times like these.

00:14:16.120 --> 00:14:18.080
Wait, don't end yet!

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:22.090
Next up is a Sana-chan
drawing song.

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:27.970
"Sana-chan's drawing song"

00:14:24.340 --> 00:14:25.340
I know this is sudden,

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:27.970
but here's a Sana-chan drawing song.
Get your paper and crayon ready!

00:14:28.010 --> 00:14:30.340
♪ First there comes
a mountain, and then, ♪

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:32.510
♪ water comes splashing down from it. ♪

00:14:32.510 --> 00:14:34.680
♪ Get two cups ready, ♪

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:36.680
♪ and then add two handles. ♪

00:14:36.680 --> 00:14:38.640
♪ Butterflies come flying in, ♪

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.650
♪ with tails growing
out of their behinds. ♪

00:14:40.690 --> 00:14:42.690
♪ Here a slope,
there a slope, ups-a-daisy, ♪

00:14:42.690 --> 00:14:44.860
♪ and draw in the eye like an arrow. ♪

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:46.860
♪ Let's draw one more arrow. ♪

00:14:46.860 --> 00:14:49.030
♪ It's time for gym,
so bring out the vaulting boxes. ♪

00:14:49.030 --> 00:14:51.030
♪ Stick a second one on top of it, ♪

00:14:51.030 --> 00:14:53.030
♪ The letter "ku," the letter "ku,"
the letter "ku," hey! ♪

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:54.990
♪ Then we stick six beans on. ♪

00:14:54.990 --> 00:14:57.370
♪ And now we've drawn Sana-chan! ♪

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:59.370
♪ Dance! Dance!
Hey! Hey! Hey! ♪

00:14:59.370 --> 00:15:02.630
♪ This is the Sana-chan drawing song! ♪

00:15:07.630 --> 00:15:10.630
Um, excuse me a moment!
Stop! Stop!

00:15:10.630 --> 00:15:14.140
You suddenly started hearing "oo-ga boo-ga,"
and thought your TV was broken, huh?

00:15:14.140 --> 00:15:17.980
Not so, ma'am. This episode
takes place in a primitive age.

00:15:17.980 --> 00:15:21.980
You won't understand most
of the dialogue, so watch out!

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:24.650
Babin-ga-bibin-ga-bonba-bibo

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:26.650
What kind of subtitle is that?

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:41.370
"School! I'm gonna be late!"

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:16.370
"I'm late for school!
Rei-kun, take me there!"

00:16:21.290 --> 00:16:24.120
Wow, they sure had some grand cars
back in primitive ages, huh?

00:16:26.630 --> 00:16:28.630
This is a prehistoric school!

00:16:28.630 --> 00:16:29.960
Pretty wild, isn't it?

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:53.320
"See here, boss monkey Hayama!
Stop acting wild at school! Make them stop!"

00:16:59.240 --> 00:17:05.710
"Where's the harm in doing bad stuff?
Schools in prehistoric times are such a drag."

00:17:03.960 --> 00:17:05.710
Did he really say all that just now?

00:17:17.840 --> 00:17:19.300
"The school has been smashed"

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:24.180
"I'm calling you out, Hayama!!"

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:47.430
"Sana, in a fight, winning
is all that matters. Winning."

00:18:54.230 --> 00:18:58.320
"Hayama, this time, you're going to fight
my dinosaur!" "That's fighting dirty."

00:18:58.320 --> 00:18:59.780
Hayama might be right about that.

00:18:58.320 --> 00:18:59.780
"Hayama, this time, you're going
to fight my dinosaur!"
"That's fighting dirty."

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:18.670
"Come on!
Apologize, Hayama!"

00:19:20.130 --> 00:19:21.840
"Kill me."

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:28.020
"There's no reason
for me to go on living."

00:19:30.440 --> 00:19:35.150
"I hate myself.
I wish I had never been born."

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:42.990
"There's no such thing as a person
who'd be better off never having been born!

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:44.620
"How can you ask me to kill you!?

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:47.200
No matter how hard it is for you,
you have to go on living!"

00:20:03.010 --> 00:20:04.340
He fell down.

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.880
You're under arrest
for the crime of pera-rimbo!

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:49.720
"He was a bad guy, but you have to feel bad
that he's been pera-rimbo-ed, huh?"

00:20:56.150 --> 00:20:57.980
"The magician manga artist, Obaba"
Who is this "Obaba"?

00:21:34.640 --> 00:21:36.310
"Sana-chan in jail"

00:21:58.380 --> 00:22:00.130
"Bottom of feet"

00:22:09.800 --> 00:22:12.010
--I'm through with this.
--Elsewhere, at that same time...

00:22:13.640 --> 00:22:16.980
Tax collector! Tax collector!
Tax collector! Tax collector!

00:22:16.980 --> 00:22:20.480
That's right! This is no time to be
putting on this sort of screwy anime!

00:22:22.980 --> 00:22:26.650
What is it? What is it?
It's so early in the morning...

00:22:26.650 --> 00:22:28.450
"Seized"

00:22:28.450 --> 00:22:30.990
What is this!?
What's going on!?

00:22:30.990 --> 00:22:35.660
The Kurata household...
has gone bankrupt.

00:22:35.660 --> 00:22:37.660
Bankrupt!?

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:40.040
"Seized"

00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:42.380
"Back against the wall."

00:22:42.880 --> 00:22:47.880
That's what you say about times like these.

00:22:49.090 --> 00:22:52.600
In dire straits,

00:22:53.350 --> 00:22:56.180
I've been waiting for an answer.

00:22:56.680 --> 00:23:00.060
My confessions are worked out
long in advance,

00:23:01.020 --> 00:23:05.150
to always go along with the scenario.

00:23:05.360 --> 00:23:11.200
My heart may be settled, but my mind is in a...

00:23:11.450 --> 00:23:13.410
...panic!!

00:23:14.450 --> 00:23:19.250
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:19.460 --> 00:23:21.920
he's there.

00:23:22.880 --> 00:23:25.210
And our usual classroom...

00:23:25.420 --> 00:23:27.800
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:30.300
...for two.

00:23:31.130 --> 00:23:33.760
Although I've said nothing but wisecracks...

00:23:33.970 --> 00:23:38.480
...up to now, just for today,

00:23:39.430 --> 00:23:42.100
I'm going to be honest and sincere,

00:23:42.310 --> 00:23:46.820
so BOY, take a look my way!

00:23:47.730 --> 00:23:52.410
When my friends invite me by, suddenly,

00:23:52.570 --> 00:23:55.080
he's there,

00:23:56.030 --> 00:23:58.240
And our usual classroom...

00:23:58.500 --> 00:24:00.830
...quick-changes into a merry-go-round...

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:03.330
...for two.

00:24:06.460 --> 00:24:09.300
Hoy! In Sana-chan's
next adventures...

00:24:09.300 --> 00:24:13.300
H- h- how can we suddenly be bankrupt!?
What happened to the Kurata household!?

00:24:13.300 --> 00:24:15.640
I won't stand for being
treated like this, sir!

00:24:15.640 --> 00:24:17.970
Those are the same kind of comments
I made last time too, huh?

00:24:17.970 --> 00:24:22.310
That's okay, that's okay, next time,
we really will continue the story!

00:24:22.310 --> 00:24:27.320
Next time on Kodomo no Omocha,
Episode 40, a tale of farewell in the rain,

00:24:27.650 --> 00:24:31.490
Suddenly, One Day,
I'm a Homeless Girl

00:24:31.490 --> 00:24:34.990
The ending song
is going to change!
